  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Strengthening Programme -Sexual Reproductive Health ZAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve young people&apos;s knowledge of their rights and access to sexual and reproductive health services. Prevention of child marriages, early pregnancy, violence against children. As a measure to reduce to reduce pregnancy and early marriage among adolescent girls and encourage girls who tend to drop out of school for these reasons, orientation on sexual reproductive health and rights is provided to both girls and boys in the target group in Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
